07-13 15:05:05","modified":"2026-07-13 08:05:05","modified_utc":"2026-07-13 15:05:05","url":"https:\/\/beoutdoorsarizona.org\/event\/petrified-forest-rogaines-2026\/2026-10-17\/","rest_url":"https:\/\/beoutdoorsarizona.org\/wp-json\/tribe\/events\/v1\/events\/10017548","title":"Petrified Forest Rogaines 2026","description":"<p>Hone your skills in the Petrified Forest at one or both of these 4-hour rogaines* on October 17th and 18th!~<\/p>\n<p><strong>Pre-registration:<\/strong> Due to participation limits inside the national park, pre-registration and pre-payment is required. Regular registration is open until Sunday, October 4 at 11:59 PM. Late registration ends on Tuesday, October 13 at 11:59 PM.<\/p>\n<p>Registration closes Tuesday night, Oct 13 at 11:59 PM.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Accommodations:<\/strong> There are a number of options for accommodations in the Holbrook area. The lodging options includes deluxe and standard motels, RV sites, cabins, paid camping, and free camping. You can click on the\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/gphxo.org\/Locations\/Holbrook_Accommodations.htm\">List of Accommodations<\/a> to see the places that have used for lodging in the past. Thanks to the local Holbrook businesses have done to help with weekend of orienteering fun.<\/p>\n<p>*<strong class=\"svelte-1fz0gqk\"><span class=\"svelte-1fz0gqk\">Rogaining<\/span><\/strong><span class=\"svelte-1fz0gqk\">\u00a0is a form of long-distance cross-country\u00a0<\/span><strong class=\"svelte-1fz0gqk\"><span class=\"svelte-1fz0gqk\">orienteering<\/span><\/strong><span class=\"svelte-1fz0gqk\"> where teams of two to five participants navigate using a map and compass to visit as many checkpoints as possible within a set time limit to maximize their score.\u00a0 <\/span><span class=\"svelte-1fz0gqk\">Unlike standard orienteering events where controls must be visited in a prescribed order, rogaining allows teams to choose the order and selection of checkpoints, adding a strategic layer to route planning